    "owner_agent": "GeoTrigo",
    "tasks": {
        "AfternoonPails": "Get 6 pails of water every afternoon",
        "LitersPerPail": "Each pail contains 5 liters of water",
        "MorningPails": "Get 5 pails of water every morning",
        "TotalWaterCalculation": "Calculate the total amount of water in liters"
    },
    "orders": [
        {
            "condition": "success",
            "from": "AfternoonPails",
            "to": "TotalWaterCalculation"
        },
        {
            "condition": "success",
            "from": "MorningPails",
            "to": "TotalWaterCalculation"
        },
        {
            "condition": "success",
            "from": "LitersPerPail",
            "to": "TotalWaterCalculation"
        }
    ],
    "refused": false,
    "answer": null
}
```

In this revised version, the "TotalWaterCalculation" task will directly use the values from "MorningPails", "AfternoonPails", and "LitersPerPail" to compute the total amount of water.

